{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.12139918009440104,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.096707817251390799,"y":0.072674418460060064,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"h":0.0095414497546228993,"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","x":0.10064748735996988,"y":0.12168276347401141,"w":0.039445765813191744},{"t":"SUSIE:","h":0.0078872398717945158,"c":1,"x":0.10073156574109653,"w":0.047508061726888026,"y":0.13777149632872654},{"y":0.183139534764028,"t":"PAUL:","c":1,"w":0.039094651540120443,"h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.1008230445031451},{"t":"SUSIE:","y":0.21366279054971915,"x":0.10288065837086632,"c":1,"w":0.045267489751180001,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.10082304531493638,"y":0.27470930207574029,"t":"PAUL:","w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1},{"t":"SUSIE:","x":0.10285848040173713,"w":0.043254232406616203,"y":0.29209600796502388,"h":0.0088312398418521898,"c":1},{"t":"PAUL:","h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1,"y":0.35319767431728555,"w":0.041152264277140305,"x":0.10288065788742076},{"x":0.10271984023878161,"h":0.010912755914515126,"t":"SUSIE:","y":0.36736338944418545,"w":0.045589125951131182,"c":1},{"w":0.041152261098225909,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.10288065978010515,"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","y":0.42877906954667067},{"h":0.0089237619766217025,"c":1,"y":0.44611951433927932,"x":0.10489769083516,"t":"SUSIE:","w":0.043291037877400726},{"y":0.46075581380054653,"t":"PAUL:","x":0.10288065783056567,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.041152264277140291},{"w":0.047325102488199863,"x":0.10493827169828691,"t":"SUSIE:","h":0.0087209303892965551,"y":0.47674418594918389,"c":1},{"x":0.10493827104531547,"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","y":0.52325581385216935},{"x":0.10697293288448918,"y":0.55371924204992462,"w":0.045313393274943034,"h":0.0088405856254946125,"c":1,"t":"SUSIE:"},{"h":0.0088102011573890637,"w":0.039134375254313167,"y":0.56972280637533501,"t":"PAUL:","c":1,"x":0.10697602214640146},{"h":0.016713832095879733,"y":0.11731807504532266,"t":"They might be interested, yes.","x":0.18092172487858363,"c":1,"w":0.24716657002766926},{"h":0.022414947707464883,"w":0.63210642496744796,"y":0.12920493542342759,"c":1,"x":0.18090463621474423,"t":"And we have a competition for children called Reading Challenge. That doesn't"},{"x":0.18306731940759846,"t":"begin until after the end of term. They have to read six books, and they get a","c":1,"w":0.60712727864583338,"h":0.015897388031401283,"y":0.14698406438383271},{"w":0.22043233235677084,"y":0.16414783552337719,"t":"certificate if they manage it.","x":0.18299320469231523,"c":1,"h":0.014662994231998017},{"y":0.17713346129806962,"t":"So that gives them something to do while they're on holiday, instead of getting","c":1,"w":0.61948435465494789,"x":0.18305198404419229,"h":0.017850149085019029},{"x":0.18312757335902086,"w":0.055555553436279298,"y":0.19622092998271712,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"bored."},{"y":0.20930232543463023,"t":"That's the idea. And there's special activities for adults too. On Friday we have a.","c":1,"x":0.18312758434272031,"w":0.6440328979492187,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"t":"local author called Tanya Streep who's going to be talking about her new novel.","y":0.22298778478118908,"w":0.62987630208333334,"h":0.017866359301815349,"x":0.18298146531122655,"c":1},{"x":0.18300800796127098,"w":0.65248728434244785,"t":"It's called 'Catch the Mouse' and she based the story on a crime that actually took.","h":0.017328984605409437,"c":1,"y":0.23911948726029553},{"y":0.25872093010384112,"t":"place here years ago.","w":0.17489711761474611,"x":0.18518518570994522,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"x":0.18299318820925292,"t":"Right. We're not free on Friday, but I'll look out for the book.","y":0.26998943859941305,"w":0.47759501139322913,"h":0.017987564118366217,"c":1},{"h":0.017955525603816747,"c":1,"t":"Now this probably isn't for you, but we do have IT support available for members.","x":0.18302416732459856,"w":0.64833104451497392,"y":0.28556627430711568},{"c":1,"x":0.18302141162299951,"y":0.30070545741656751,"w":0.65044453938802094,"t":"We get quite a few older people coming along who are wanting to get up to speed","h":0.01780278663051138},{"y":0.3158536559666536,"x":0.18299491937933035,"t":"with computer technology. It's on Tuesday mornings - they don't need to make an.","w":0.654555409749349,"c":1,"h":0.018139499938389703},{"w":0.33969154357910158,"t":"appointment or anything, they just turn up.","x":0.18300899404275658,"h":0.016016318183063261,"c":1,"y":0.33292464648025732},{"t":"Well, my mother might be interested, I'll let her know.","h":0.017820630112862501,"w":0.42615821838378909,"c":1,"x":0.18299613868522879,"y":0.34744977531442922},{"t":"OK. And there's another service which you wouldn't expect from a library, which is.","c":1,"y":0.36249544546452839,"w":0.65449462890624999,"x":0.18506733009687518,"h":0.017091588783039402},{"c":1,"t":"a free medical check-up. The hospital arranges for someone to come along and","y":0.37926972888058896,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.18312757667132379,"w":0.63580245971679683},{"c":1,"t":"measure the level of sugar in your blood, and they check cholesterol levels at the","x":0.18505906667971211,"w":0.64428894042968743,"h":0.017430423426543884,"y":0.39334761324491985},{"y":0.41251117090001244,"c":1,"w":0.090693537394205742,"h":0.01364044867921077,"t":"same time.","x":0.1851059062329585},{"t":"Yes, but that's only for the over-60s, so you wouldn't qualify.","w":0.47969528198242184,"c":1,"x":0.18503971369074998,"y":0.43989376101572952,"h":0.018556521834698136},{"h":0.016872119566577082,"c":1,"t":"OK. Well, I'Il tell my mother, she might be interested.","x":0.18511105725430743,"y":0.45632811389259875,"w":0.42194320678710939},{"t":"What other information... well, we do have a little shop with things like wallcharts","x":0.1851081719143042,"y":0.4705231536121538,"c":1,"w":0.65239069620768231,"h":0.017252009945567304},{"c":1,"x":0.18511178253522947,"t":"and greetings cards, and also stamps so you can post the cards straightaway,","y":0.48668704618065539,"w":0.62152989705403638,"h":0.016503651936848995},{"t":"which is really useful.","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.17489711761474611,"y":0.50436046498964104,"x":0.18518518595571568},{"y":0.51662040945822441,"w":0.66476628621419276,"x":0.18510560750763355,"c":1,"h":0.01735041251030911,"t":"Yeah. Well, I'll bring the children round at the weekend and we'll join. Oh, one more"},{"t":"thing - I'Il be bringing the car, is there parking available?","y":0.5332192478549217,"h":0.016847854227845627,"x":0.18509704322102272,"w":0.45081904093424474,"c":1},{"t":"Yes, and it's free in the evening and at weekends.","x":0.18714770015002452,"y":0.54919331032437979,"c":1,"w":0.39933110555013024,"h":0.016372279649067178},{"w":0.31069959004720055,"c":1,"h":0.014570836043610536,"t":"Perfect. Well, thanks, Susie see you...","x":0.18724279742495942,"y":0.56537102453890742},{"x":0.85185185159198773,"y":0.20784883703724277,"w":0.02880658467610675,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q6","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"SECTION 2","y":0.63074204920642218,"w":0.15432098388671878,"x":0.10699588659217402,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"t":"In this session in your training day we're going to look at some of the more specialised holidays","x":0.10479423547201558,"h":0.02024103755524076,"w":0.74101099650065105,"c":1,"y":0.65480876484951311},{"c":1,"x":0.10689598958816086,"w":0.69566426595052089,"h":0.016819263655951211,"y":0.67140460173079575,"t":"we offer at BC Travel. Now, the travel business is very competitive and it's important to be"},{"h":0.015988372380376759,"w":0.73251027425130211,"t":"aware of how the market's changing and developing. In terms of age groups, the over-65s are","c":1,"y":0.68749999984808174,"x":0.10493827864160532},{"h":0.021520263033845466,"c":1,"x":0.10475047481946007,"t":"an important market, and one that's increasing steadily year on year. The fewest holidays are","y":0.70053260047972066,"w":0.72462595621744785},{"x":0.10479213090672497,"w":0.73076985677083328,"t":"taken by the 31 to 42-year-olds, and that figure shows no sign of rising. The biggest market at","y":0.71674826581738971,"h":0.020403038626986447,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"present is still the youngest group, the 16 to 30s, but this group's also seen the biggest drop","x":0.10684581128665106,"w":0.71221628824869798,"h":0.019280913300171565,"y":0.73305295225725187},{"t":"over the last few years, whereas there's a noticeable growth in the number of holidays taken","w":0.71835596720377604,"x":0.10686469285122314,"y":0.74778959242147591,"h":0.019285561479584157,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"by the 55 to 64-year-olds. As far as the 43 to 54-year-olds are concerned, bookings there are","h":0.017942621794971303,"x":0.1069188843581505,"y":0.76409398334727407,"w":0.72236648559570305},{"h":0.016438666165085603,"t":"steady, but I have to say we haven't seen the increase we expected.","w":0.53105682373046881,"c":1,"x":0.10893180434251207,"y":0.7803985035580937},{"y":0.80196258532004583,"t":"One trend we're noticing with nearly all age groups is the growing popularity of holidays","h":0.01960848077025934,"x":0.10890209122674283,"w":0.69369990030924478,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"in which clients do some kind of specialised activity. I'm not talking here about adventure","x":0.10699587917209195,"y":0.81831395333844981,"w":0.70370371500651041,"h":0.015988372380376759},{"w":0.7307324727376302,"c":1,"t":"holidays, where clients take part in high-risk activities like white water rafting just for the thrill","x":0.10892551429270592,"y":0.83317565661800996,"h":0.018962689367143848},{"w":0.73681930541992191,"y":0.84848207331885117,"x":0.10688237325606148,"t":"of it. Activity holidays usually involve rather less high-risk sports, or things like art and music.","h":0.019250258680507559,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.72648905436197919,"x":0.10897062670851768,"t":"They're not necessarily cheaper than ordinary holidays, often the opposite, in fact. But they","y":0.86363389601767326,"h":0.019280223599311475},{"w":0.71009099324544267,"t":"do often take place outside the main tourist centres, which gives an opportunity for clients","x":0.10893780244086788,"c":1,"h":0.017583769538798477,"y":0.87970303702311203},{"t":"to find out more about the local people and customs, and many say this is one of the most","x":0.10891583108689257,"h":0.019417680756082523,"y":0.89456505811643627,"c":1,"w":0.71632909138997403},{"t":"positive features of these holidays. Of course, they offer the chance to develop a new skill or","y":0.90961770151665777,"x":0.11097826138552108,"c":1,"w":0.7348068745930989,"h":0.018406760706637493},{"x":0.10905349900869737,"w":0.039094648361206047,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"y":0.94476744158450099,"t":"106"},{"x":0.86213991684280622,"c":1,"t":"Q13 &","y":0.86482558125163245,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.053497943878173859},{"c":1,"t":"Q14","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.87936046495784592,"w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.86213991829901793},{"y":0.96518376438645559,"w":0.2065745035807291,"x":0.39469719730021241,"h":0.019023014603290145,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org"}]}